Description: Zovelis OS desktop look and default settings
 The Zovelis OS look for the KDE Plasma desktop:
  * "Zovelis Light" and "Zovelis Dark" global themes (System Settings >
    Colors & Themes), each with matching colours, icons and wallpaper,
  * the default desktop layout: one taskbar along the bottom with the
    Zovelis menu, pinned apps, notification area, clock and date,
  * a splash screen and a login screen in the Zovelis style,
  * sensible system-wide defaults: default applications, light-weight file
    search, and the information shown in About this System.
 .
 All of these are defaults: every user can change them in System Settings.
